    "https://www.pacificu.edu/faculty-staff": {
      "title": "Main navigation",
      "description": "Information for Faculty & Staff | Pacific University Skip to main content Home Search Main navigation Academics Admissions Life at Pacific About Secondary menu Search Main menu (Mobile) Academics Admissions Life at Pacific About Quick links Calendar Athletics Libraries Office Directory Give Information for ... Current Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Community Information for Faculty & Staff Pacific University faculty & staff, this is your one-stop page for news, events and resources for you! More details? Use the site search or browse the office directory for additional information. Looking for a Pacific employee? Search faculty and staff profiles , or log into the private directory with your PUNetID for contact info for your colleagues or students. Announcements Work and Service Fair 2026 Body Come and recruit students at the annual Fall Work & Service Fair and Partner in the UC on September 22nd from 11:00 am - 1:00 pm! Prior to the event, campus and community partners are also encouraged to attend the Partner With Pacific information session from 9:30 - 10:30 am. Read more about Work and Service Fair 2026 We Hope To See You At This Year's State Of The University Body Join President Jenny Coyle for this year's State of the University for an employee-focused university update on Friday, Sept. 25, at 3 p.m. in McCready Hall or via Zoom. This year’s update will focus on Pacific’s strategic plan, along with updates on the planned merger with Willamette University. Following the presentation, employees are invited to stay for a reception featuring snacks, selfies with Boxer and opportunities to get some Pacific swag! Read more about We Hope To See You At This Year's State Of The University Mandatory I-9 Supervisor Training Body Please join us for our next I-9 Supervisor Training on September 15. Read more about Mandatory I-9 Supervisor Training Come Volunteer With Us Body Join us for the 62nd Annual Forest Grove Corn Roast on Saturday, September 19, and get involved in one of the community’s biggest events of the year! Volunteers can choose from a variety of roles and shifts between 8 a.m. and 4 p.m. on College Way, making it a great opportunity to meet new people, connect with the Forest Grove community, and volunteer with friends, roommates, teammates, or club members. Read more about Come Volunteer With Us Road Closures for Annual Forest Grove Corn Roast Body College Way and 21st Avenue will be closed beginning at 8 p.m. on Friday, September 18, through 6 p.m. on Saturday, September 19, 2026, for the annual Forest Grove Corn Roast. Pacific students, faculty, and staff are encouraged to plan ahead and allow extra time for parking and travel around campus during this community celebration. Read more about Road Closures for Annual Forest Grove Corn Roast See all employee announcements Upcoming Events Sep 9 Art Opening Cawein Gallery: Karl LeClair | Undetermined State All day | Wednesday, September 9, 2026 Forest Grove Please join us in welcoming Karl LeClair to Pacific University's Cawein Gallery. His art show \"Undetermined State\" will be on display from August 31 through September 28 at the gallery. There will be an artist reception Sept. 10 from 5 to 8 p.m. Sep 10 Art Opening Cawein Gallery: Karl LeClair | Undetermined State All day | Thursday, September 10, 2026 Forest Grove Please join us in welcoming Karl LeClair to Pacific University's Cawein Gallery. His art show \"Undetermined State\" will be on display from August 31 through September 28 at the gallery. There will be an artist reception Sept. 10 from 5 to 8 p.m. Sep 10 University Council | September 2026 4 pm to 6 pm | Thursday, September 10, 2026 Online, Forest Grove, Berglund Hall, Conference Room (Room 200) University Council meetings are open to all Pacific community members. Sep 11 Art Opening Cawein Gallery: Karl LeClair | Undetermined State All day | Friday, September 11, 2026 Forest Grove Please join us in welcoming Karl LeClair to Pacific University's Cawein Gallery. His art show \"Undetermined State\" will be on display from August 31 through September 28 at the gallery. There will be an artist reception Sept. 10 from 5 to 8 p.m. Sep 11 Pacific's Shared Governance Online Training  | September 11 11 am to 11:50 am | Friday, September 11, 2026 Online Join a 45-minute training session for anyone interested in learning about Pacific’s shared governance system, best practices for standing committees, and Robert’s Rules parliamentarian procedures. If you are serving on a university standing committee and have not attended this training before, please consider attending. See all employee events Paragraphs Quick Links Online Tools Services Portal: Request technology help, view and manage your help requests, and read knowledgebase articles. You also can contact the Helpdesk by phone at 503-352-1500 or via Zoom (hours are limited) BoxerOnline Self Service : Enter grades and find rosters; review advisee plans; update direct deposit info; manage department budgets. BoxerMail: Email, hosted by Google Moodle : Online learning/class portal MyAccount: Manage your PUNet account and personal information, including address MyBoxer: Customizable dashboard to manage all things Pacific PayCom: Human Resources and payroll system All Online Tools Academics Accreditation: Statement of accreditation for each academic program Academic Catalog: View degree requirements, course listings and more Academic Programs: Discover all of Pacific's academic programs and pathways Libraries: Access materials, study guides, course reserves and databases, find study spaces, and more Registrar’s Office: Information about student academic records, including transcripts and enrollment Business & Finance Accounts Payable: Invoice payments, check requests, reimbursements Marketplace: Pacific online stores Purchasing: Purchase orders, credit cards Communications Announcements : Internal announcements for the Pacific community Website User Portal : Log in with single sign-on to add announcements, news posts and calendar events Brand Standards : Logo, color, font and editorial guidelines for representing Pacific DIY Toolkit: Templates, digital assets, stock photos, and more Pacific Magazine: University magazine featuring alumni, students, families and friends Website Request Form : Submit minor updates for the website Social Media Guidelines: Using social media for business purposes Services Portal: Project requests, web updates Diversity and Inclusion Bias & Hate Incident Education: Identifying and reporting incidents Office of Equity, Diversity & Inclusion Workshops: Request training or workshops Employee Services Employee Benefits: Benefit information for employees Employee Assistance Program: Tools and services through Canopy Holiday Schedule: List of paid holidays for employees Ombuds Resource: Confidential support through communication, conflict and other university-related concerns Open Positions: Pacific University job postings PayCom: Online HR system Payroll: Employee pay information Event Services Catering: Campus catering through Bon Appetit EMS Room Scheduling: Schedule spaces on campus Facilities Campus Amenities: Lactation rooms, all-gender restrooms Facilities Work Requests: Online system for requesting repairs Key Requests: Key orders and replacements Mail Services: Send and receive postal mail from your campus box Interactive Campus Map Motor Pool: University vehicle use Service Center: Printing and copying center Governance Academic Program Proposals: Process for proposing new academic programs Board of Trustees Faculty & Governance Handbook Faculty Senate Staff Senate University Council Health & Wellness Boxer Food Share: Food pantry on the Forest Grove Campus Public Clinics: Pacific-operated healthcare clinics Student & Employee Health Center: Healthcare services for students and employees Policies & Forms Policies & Forms: Find policies that affect the university community Research Research Compliance & Integrity: Regulatory committees and policies for research Scholarship & Sponsored Projects: Support for research and scholarly work funding and management Safety Boxer Alerts: Review your contact info for emergency alerts Business Continuity & Emergency Management: Emergency preparedness and response plans Campus Public Safety: On-site security and safety Teaching & Supporting Students Academic Advising Handbook Accessibility & Accommodation Faculty Resources Care Referral: Report a concern about a student Center for Educational Technology & Curriculum Innovation: Best practices for integrating technology into teaching CLASS Peer Tutoring International Student Faculty Resources: How to teach and support international students Title IX Resources Undocumented/DACA Student Resources for Educators Title Share Info Text Box Log In To Add Content This is your space to share information with fellow employees and Pacific students! Below, you'll find a listing of upcoming events and announcements. Events and announcements tagged for \"current students\" and/or \"faculty & staff\" also are included in our weekly e-newsletters each Thursday! Learn how to publish an announcement or submit an event in the Services Portal. Or just log into the website below to get started! Log In Footer Menu Support at Pacific Emergency Information Tech Support Newsroom Careers at Pacific Policies & Forms Office Directory Facebook Instagram Youtube Tiktok Linkedin home link 2043 College Way Forest Grove, OR 97116 503-352-6151 Online Privacy Digital Accessibility Non-Discrimination Copyright © Pacific University all rights reserved"
