      "description": "Life & Career Events | Pacific University Skip to main content Home Search Main navigation Academics Admissions Life at Pacific About Secondary menu Search Main menu (Mobile) Academics Admissions Life at Pacific About Quick links Calendar Athletics Libraries Office Directory Give Information for ... Current Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Community In this section ... Life & Career Events Growing Your Family Getting Married or Divorced Breadcrumb Office Directory Finance & Administration Human Resources Employee Benefits Life & Career Events Life & Career Events Paragraphs Starting a new job. Retiring. Getting married. Becoming a parent. These and many other life events may affect your life at Pacific University, as well as your employee benefits and finances. Read through these quick resources for navigating in your personal and professional life, and contact Human Resources for more information. Keep Exploring Bottom Related Content Teaser Title Growing your Family Teaser Title Getting Married or Divorced Footer Menu Support at Pacific Emergency Information Tech Support Newsroom Careers at Pacific Policies & Forms Office Directory Facebook Instagram Youtube Tiktok Linkedin home link 2043 College Way Forest Grove, OR 97116 503-352-6151 Online Privacy Digital Accessibility Non-Discrimination Copyright © Pacific University all rights reserved"
